    "harmony_adaptation": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Dimension 9 — MODEL (skill: harmony-adaptation). SYNTHESIS dimension: HarmonyOS NEXT PC 移植分级（核心功能 vs 平台差异功能两维可适配性）+ 工作量 of porting the library to HarmonyOS NEXT PC (self-kernel, ArkTS app layer, OHOS NDK native layer, Node-API bridge — NO Linux ABI). Derived by reasoning over the already-filled native_api / runtime_surface / dependencies / build_env / library blocks, reusing their evidence. Prose in 简体中文.",
      "properties": {
        "target": {"type": "string", "description": "中文/英文：评估所针对的鸿蒙平台口径（HarmonyOS NEXT PC 等）"},
        "porting_class": {"type": "string", "enum": ["no_adaptation", "recompile_only", "needs_adaptation"],
          "description": "★唯一权威机器轴（3 值顶层移植分级）。**由 scripts/report_normalize.py 组装时确定性归一并落盘**（web/server.js 为等价镜像）：模型给出整体判断作“下限”，归一据 dim-12 code_partition 的 needs_adaptation/unadaptable 桶与 dim-9 unadaptable_apis 把它**只升不降**。语义：no_adaptation=无需适配（纯脚本/纯 Go/纯 Rust 跑已移植运行时、无原生扩展无平台 API，交叉编译属工具链重定向≠适配）；recompile_only=仅交叉编译（C/C++ 原生、仅 OHOS NDK 重编、零源码改动、无平台 API）；needs_adaptation=需适配（需真正改源码/换鸿蒙方案）。硬约束（归一保证，非模型自查）：unadaptable_apis 非空、任一 blocker adaptability=unadaptable/partial、或 dim-12 有 needs_adaptation 桶 ⇒ 至少 needs_adaptation。**needs_adaptation 内部的核心功能/平台差异功能两维细分与总判见派生字段 adaptation_assessment。**"},
        "porting_class_model": {"type": ["string", "null"],
          "description": "归一前模型给出的 porting_class 原值（advisory，单次记录、跨重归一稳定；模型省略则 null）。与归一后的 porting_class 不同则同时记 porting_class_adjusted 并进 meta.harmony_warnings。"},
        "porting_class_adjusted": {"type": "object",
          "description": "归一把模型原判校正为更严格类别时记录 {from,to}，供面板/校验透明展示。",
          "properties": {"from": {"type": "string"}, "to": {"type": "string"}}},
        "adaptation_assessment": {"type": "object",
          "description": "★派生字段（由 scripts/report_normalize.py 组装时据 porting_class + unadaptable_apis[].functionality_class 确定性算出并落盘，web/server.js 镜像 serve-time 升级；模型无需填）。把 needs_adaptation 沿「核心功能 vs 平台差异功能」两维细分，并派生拓扑上色用的 5 档 effective_class 与「是否可适配」总判 overall。核心功能=Windows/Linux/macOS 平台功能的交集；平台差异功能=平台特有（非交集）。",
          "properties": {
            "effective_class": {"type": "string", "enum": ["no_adaptation", "recompile_only", "needs_adaptation", "needs_adaptation_platform_partial", "needs_adaptation_core_partial"],
              "description": "闭轴（派生，依赖拓扑图上色 + 难度 floor + rollup 用）：no_adaptation / recompile_only / needs_adaptation（核心+平台均全部可适配）/ needs_adaptation_platform_partial（平台差异功能有不可适配点、核心全可适配）/ needs_adaptation_core_partial（核心功能有不可适配点——最重）。worst-wins：核心不可适配 > 平台不可适配。"},
            "overall": {"type": "string", "enum": ["adaptable", "adaptable_with_tailoring", "core_blocked"],
              "description": "闭轴（派生，替代旧 feasibility 的「是否可适配」总判）：adaptable=可适配；adaptable_with_tailoring=可适配（部分平台特性需裁剪，即 platform_partial）；core_blocked=核心功能不完全可适配（core_partial）。"},
            "core": {"type": "object",
              "description": "核心功能维度评估。",
              "properties": {
                "adaptable": {"type": "boolean", "description": "核心功能是否全部可适配（无不可适配点）"},
                "unadaptable": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}, "description": "核心功能中不可适配点的 unadaptable_apis[].id 列表（单一登记源，明细在 unadaptable_apis）"}}},
            "platform_specific": {"type": "object",
              "description": "平台差异功能维度评估。",
              "properties": {
                "adaptable": {"type": "boolean", "description": "平台差异功能是否全部可适配（无不可适配点）"},
                "unadaptable": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}, "description": "平台差异功能中不可适配点的 unadaptable_apis[].id 列表"}}}}},
        "functional_viability": {"type": "string", "enum": ["viable", "viable_with_work", "blocked_external", "unverified"],
          "description": "★派生字段（scripts/report_normalize.py 组装时据 target_assumptions[].target_status 确定性算出、web/server.js serve-time 按 live caps 回投后重算；模型无需填）。与源侧 porting_class/adaptation_assessment 正交的「运行前提是否满足」目标侧总判：viable=前提齐备；viable_with_work=有 partial 前提需处理；blocked_external=有 required 前提在目标不可用（如 shell-out 库依赖的外部二进制），此时代码轴仍可为 no_adaptation（代码无需改，功能受阻于外部前提）；unverified=有 required 前提未核实(unknown)。worst-wins：blocked_external>unverified>viable_with_work>viable。面板/xlsx 与 adaptation_assessment.overall 两轴并列展示。"},
